Usage: expand [OPTION]... [FILE]...

Convert tabs to spaces.

Convert each tab character to one or more spaces.
By default, tabs are converted to 8 spaces.

Supports GNU tab lists, including /N and +N repeat tab stops.

OPTIONS:
  -t, --tabs ARG  specify tab stop positions (default: 8)
  -i, --initial   only convert tabs at the beginning of lines
  -NUM            same as --tabs=NUM
      --help      display this help and exit
  -V, --version   output version information and exit

EXIT STATUS:
  0  if OK,
  1  if minor problems,
  2  if serious trouble.

WinuxCmd is a Windows implementation of GNU CoreUtils for Linux-Windows developers and AI coding assistants.
